bluejetty:00036411:ios.description:
All-in-one mobile security and privacy app for a safer digital life.
MyCyberHome will help you secure:
• Your mobile device by checking its common security settings;
• Your online browsing by blocking ads, trackers and Internet traffic from malicious web sites;
• Your passwords and confidential data with its secured encrypted vault;
• Your home wifi network by identifying potential threats and vulnerabilities;
• Your online identity by monitoring online breaches involving your email addresses and social media accounts;
• Your privacy by creating private email aliases to help you hide your email and stay anonymous online.
--- 
If you like the app, feel free to take a minute to show us your support with a review.
If you need assistance or want share some feedback and suggestion, please get in touch with us through the app's Settings/Feedback section."
PREMIUM SUBSCRIPTION:
MyCyberHome offers an optional auto-renewable premium subscriptions at $6.99 per month or $57.99 per year (prices vary by region).
Payment will be charged to your iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase and auto-renews at the same price unless disabled in iTunes Account Settings at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Your subscription can be managed in your iTunes Account Settings. No cancellation of the current subscription is allowed during the active subscription period.
* The use of MyCyberHome is subject to Apple's Standard End User License Agreement available here: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/
* Privacy policy: https://mycyberhome.com/privacy

