bluejetty:00039908:ios.description:
Gimbal Show
Gimbal Show is a photography app with a handheld gimbal stabilizer to add more different experiences for shooting enthusiasts.
1.Real-time preview of high-definition shooting screens, which can adjust the focal length and white balance at any time during shooting, and support 4K video recording;
2.Follow the rich template shooting, you can make a film with one click;
3.It can intelligently recognize faces for live broadcast tracking, bringing users a more accurate and convenient live broadcast experience;
4.Provide professional stabilizer personalized parameter setting;
5.This software can be connected with the wireless remote control to control the mobile phone, so as to control the mobile phone at a longer distance.

